node_modules
out
dist
.git
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store

# Runtime state and personal data. The image must never carry these: `COPY . .`
# would otherwise bake live bank statements, trade history, agent mandates and
# the audit log into image layers, where they survive in any registry the image
# is pushed to and in anyone's `docker save`. The runtime named volume mounts
# over /app/data, but Docker SEEDS an empty named volume from the image contents,
# so leaving them here is load-bearing, not merely untidy.
# Mirrors the financial-documents rules in .gitignore — keep the two in step.
data/
private/
/btc-ladder-report-*.md
/*-report-*.md

# Claude Code local config, commands, and generated plan/scratch files
.claude/

# Test/coverage output and design mockups the app never imports
coverage/
mockups/
*.code-workspace

# Python bytecode from the screening engine
__pycache__/
*.pyc
